== Trivia ==
* Aurene's Argument shares the same arm auras, footfalls, and kill animation with the other Aurene legendary weapons, as they are all themed after her.
* The name may be a reference to the [[w:Canon de 24 de Vallière|Canon de 24 de Vallière]], which was inscribed with the Latin phrase "Ultima Ratio Regum" (The Last Argument of Kings).

